:: Nursery encounter - rebellious teen [bg-nursery]
<h1 class="ptitle">NURSERY</h1>
<br /><br />
/* A caretaker and a defiant teenager are at odds. How fair each of them is being depends on their personalities. */
<<set _enc = setup.nurseryEncounters>>
<<set _cast = _enc.cast()>>
<<if !_cast>>
	<<goto 'Nursery'>>
<<else>>
<<set _carer = _cast.carer>>
<<set _kid = _cast.kid>>
<<set _name = setup.displayName(_carer)>>
<<set _own = _enc.isOwnChild(_kid)>>
<<set _kidHe = setup.pronounceWhat(_kid)>>
<<set _kidHis = setup.pronounceWhos(_kid)>>
<<set _kidHim = setup.pronounceWho(_kid)>>
<<set _issue = _enc.teenIssue(_carer, _kid, _enc.currentSlot())>>

You walk in on a standoff. <<=_enc.fill(_issue.scene, _kid)>> <<=_kid.name>> has <<=_kidHis>> arms folded and <<=_kidHis>> jaw set, and <<=_name>> is standing over <<=_kidHim>> with <<=setup.pronounceWhos(_carer)>> hands on <<=setup.pronounceWhos(_carer)>> hips.
<br /><br />
"<<=_enc.fill(_issue.teen, _kid)>>" <<=_kid.name>> says.
<br /><br />
<<sayNpc _carer>>
	<<=_enc.fill(_issue.carer, _kid)>>
<</sayNpc>>
<br />
<<if _own>>
	<<=_kid.name>> sees you first. <<=ucfirst(_kidHis)>> chin comes up.
	<br /><br />
	"<<=setup.npc.mcName(_kid, true)>>, tell <<=setup.pronounceWho(_carer)>>."
<<else>>
	The younger children have gone quiet, and they keep looking from <<=_kid.name>> to <<=_name>> to you, waiting to see what happens.
<</if>>
<br /><br />

<div id="nce_choices">
	<<link `'Side with ' + _kid.name`>>
		<<replace '#nce_choices'>>
			<<if _own>>
				<<run _enc.change(_kid, 'relationship', 4, 6)>>
				<<run _enc.change(_carer, 'relationship', -3, -1)>>
			<<else>>
				<<run _enc.change(_kid, 'relationship', 3, 5)>>
				<<run _enc.change(_carer, 'relationship', -4, -2)>>
			<</if>>
			You tell <<=_name>> to let it go, this once, and that <<=_kid.name>> has a point. <<=_kid.name>> looks startled, then tries to hide it. <<=_name>> says nothing for a moment.
			<br /><br />
			<<sayNpc _carer>>
				As you say. I'd just ask you to remember who has to keep order in here after you've gone.
			<</sayNpc>>
			<br />
			[[Continue|Nursery]]
			<<nurseryEffects>>
		<</replace>>
	<</link>>
	<<link `'Side with ' + _name`>>
		<<replace '#nce_choices'>>
			<<if _own>>
				<<run _enc.change(_kid, 'relationship', -6, -4)>>
				<<run _enc.change(_carer, 'relationship', 3, 5)>>
			<<else>>
				<<run _enc.change(_kid, 'relationship', -4, -2)>>
				<<run _enc.change(_carer, 'relationship', 3, 5)>>
			<</if>>
			You tell <<=_kid.name>> that <<=_name>> runs this room, and that <<=_kidHe>> will do as <<=_kidHe>> is told. <<=_name>> gives you a small nod of thanks. <<=_kid.name>> glares at the floor.
			<br /><br />
			<<if _own>>
				"Figures," <<=_kidHe>> mutters. "I don't know why I thought you'd listen."
			<<else>>
				"Whatever," <<=_kidHe>> mutters, and goes to do it anyway.
			<</if>>
			<br /><br />
			[[Continue|Nursery]]
			<<nurseryEffects>>
		<</replace>>
	<</link>>
	<<link 'Try to find a middle ground'>>
		<<replace '#nce_choices'>>
			<<run _enc.change(_carer, 'relationship', 1, 3)>>
			<<run _enc.change(_kid, 'relationship', 1, 3)>>
			You take the heat out of it, and get them both to say what they want without shouting. <<=_kid.name>> agrees to do <<=_kidHis>> part if <<=_name>> will ease up a little, and <<=_name>> agrees that this seems reasonable. Neither of them gets everything, and neither of them seems to mind as much as they did a minute ago.
			<br /><br />
			[[Continue|Nursery]]
			<<nurseryEffects>>
		<</replace>>
	<</link>>
	<<link 'Stay out of it'>>
		<<replace '#nce_choices'>>
			<<if _own>>
				<<run _enc.change(_kid, 'relationship', -4, -2)>>
				<<run setup.nurseryBehavior.change(-2, -1)>>
				You look at the two of them and decide this isn't your fight. <<=_kid.name>> stares at you as you turn away, then starts shouting again, louder. Behind you, some of the younger children have started to pick up on it.
			<<else>>
				You look at the two of them and decide this isn't your fight. By the time you reach the far side of the room, they are back at it.
			<</if>>
			<br /><br />
			[[Continue|Nursery]]
			<<nurseryEffects>>
		<</replace>>
	<</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
